  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "$P^{T}=2 P+I$\r\n\r\n$\\begin{array}{l}\r\n\r\n\\Rightarrow P=2 P^{T}+I \\Rightarrow P=2(2 P+I)+I \\\\\r\n\r\n\\Rightarrow P=4 P+3 I \\Rightarrow P+I=0 \\\\\r\n\r\n\\Rightarrow P X+X=0 \\Rightarrow P X=-X\r\n\r\n\\end{array}$",
